{"seq":3,"slug":"basic-nursing-skills","title":"大学护理学 — 基础护理技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/basic-nursing-skills","wordCount":1968,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学护理学-基础护理技术\">大学护理学 — 基础护理技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>基础护理技术是每位护士必须掌握的临床操作核心能力，涵盖了从生命体征测量到静脉输液、从无菌操作到给药技术的全方位实践技能。这些技术看似常规，却是保障患者安全的基石——一次不规范的注射操作可能引发感染，一次不准确的生命体征监测可能延误危急情况的识别。基础护理技术的精确执行需要反复训练和严格的标准化流程，是护理专业教育的实践核心。</p>\n<p>核心技能领域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生命体征监测</strong>：体温、脉搏、呼吸、血压的测量与记录</li>\n<li><strong>无菌技术</strong>：无菌操作原则、消毒与灭菌方法</li>\n<li><strong>给药技术</strong>：口服给药、注射技术（皮内/皮下/肌肉/静脉）、输液管理</li>\n<li><strong>基本生活护理</strong>：体位安置、皮肤护理、排泄护理</li>\n<li><strong>标本采集</strong>：血液、尿液、痰液等标本的规范采集</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-生命体征监测\">一、生命体征监测</h3><p>生命体征是反映机体基本生命活动状态的指标，包括体温（T）、脉搏（P）、呼吸（R）和血压（BP），加上疼痛评分被称为&quot;第五生命体征&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>正常值参考范围</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>成人正常值</th>\n<th>异常标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体温</td>\n<td>腋温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36.0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>37.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36.0 \\sim 37.0°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37.0°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>37.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 37.3°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37.3°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为发热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉搏</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60 \\sim 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 心动过缓，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 心动过速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呼吸</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12 \\sim 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 呼吸急促，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 呼吸过缓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血压</td>\n<td>收缩压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>139</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90 \\sim 139</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">139</span></span></span></span></span> mmHg</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>140</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 140/90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140/90</span></span></span></span></span> mmHg 为高血压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 为严重低氧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>血压测量的规范化要点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>测量前安静休息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，排空膀胱</li>\n<li>袖带宽度应为上臂周径的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>，过窄偏高、过宽偏低</li>\n<li>袖带下缘距肘窝 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\sim 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> cm</li>\n<li>听诊器膜面置于肱动脉搏动处，不可塞入袖带下方</li>\n<li>Korotkoff 音第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 音为收缩压，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 音（消失音）为舒张压</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>发热的护理要点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>体温上升期：保暖、减少散热</li>\n<li>高热持续期：物理降温（温水擦浴、冰袋放置于大血管处）、遵医嘱药物降温</li>\n<li>退热期：及时擦干汗液、更换衣被、防虚脱</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-无菌技术\">二、无菌技术</h3><p>无菌技术是预防医院感染的基石。护士必须内化无菌观念——保持&quot;无菌即有菌&quot;的警惕心态。</p>\n<p><strong>无菌操作基本原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>环境清洁：操作前清洁操作台面，减少人员流动</li>\n<li>无菌区域：只能放置无菌物品，物品一旦取出不可放回</li>\n<li>无菌物品取用：使用无菌持物钳或戴无菌手套</li>\n<li>有效期管理：已打开的无菌包 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 小时内有效（注明时间）</li>\n<li>潮湿即污染：任何接触到非无菌表面水分的物品视为污染</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常用消毒灭菌方法</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用物品</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高压蒸汽灭菌</td>\n<td>高温高压</td>\n<td>手术器械、敷料、棉球</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>121</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">121°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">121°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>103.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">103.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">103.4</span></span></span></span></span> kPa，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 \\sim 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环氧乙烷灭菌</td>\n<td>烷化蛋白质</td>\n<td>不耐热物品（塑料、橡胶）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55 \\sim 60°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紫外线消毒</td>\n<td>破坏 DNA</td>\n<td>空气和物体表面</td>\n<td>距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> m，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学浸泡</td>\n<td>化学杀菌</td>\n<td>精密仪器</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span></span></span></span></span> 戊二醛浸泡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> h</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-注射技术\">三、注射技术</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[注射技术] --&gt; B[皮内注射 ID]&#10;    A --&gt; C[皮下注射 SC]&#10;    A --&gt; D[肌肉注射 IM]&#10;    A --&gt; E[静脉注射 IV]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[前臂掌侧下1/3 / 5°角 / 0.1mL]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[上臂三角肌下缘 / 30-40°角 / ≤1mL]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[臀大肌/三角肌 / 90°角 / ≤2-5mL]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[表浅静脉 / 15-30°角]\">graph TD\n    A[注射技术] --&gt; B[皮内注射 ID]\n    A --&gt; C[皮下注射 SC]\n    A --&gt; D[肌肉注射 IM]\n    A --&gt; E[静脉注射 IV]\n    B --&gt; B1[前臂掌侧下1/3 / 5°角 / 0.1mL]\n    C --&gt; C1[上臂三角肌下缘 / 30-40°角 / ≤1mL]\n    D --&gt; D1[臀大肌/三角肌 / 90°角 / ≤2-5mL]\n    E --&gt; E1[表浅静脉 / 15-30°角]</pre><p><strong>皮内注射（ID）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>目的：皮肤过敏试验（青霉素、破伤风抗毒素）、卡介苗接种</li>\n<li>部位：前臂掌侧下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>进针角度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5°</span></span></span></span></span>，针尖斜面完全进入皮内</li>\n<li>药液量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> mL，注射后形成直径约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> cm 的皮丘</li>\n<li>青霉素皮试阳性判断：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟后皮丘直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> cm、局部红晕、有伪足</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>肌肉注射（IM）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最常用部位：臀大肌（连线定位法——髂前上棘至尾骨连线的外上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span> 处）</li>\n<li>进针角度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span></span></span></span></span>，深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5 \\sim 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> cm</li>\n<li>回抽确认：进针后回抽无血液方可注射</li>\n<li>注意：避免坐骨神经损伤（臀大肌注射最严重的并发症）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>静脉输液管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>滴速计算：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>每分钟滴数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>输液总量(mL)</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>滴系数</mtext></mrow><mtext>输液时间(min)</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{每分钟滴数} = \\frac{\\text{输液总量(mL)} \\times \\text{滴系数}}{\\text{输液时间(min)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每分钟滴数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">输液时间</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">(min)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">输液总量</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">(mL)</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">滴系数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>常规滴系数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 滴/mL（普通输液器）</li>\n<li>成人常规滴速：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40 \\sim 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 滴/分</li>\n<li>输液反应监测：发热反应（寒战、高热）、循环负荷过重（呼吸困难、咳粉红色泡沫痰）、空气栓塞（胸闷、呼吸困难，左侧卧位头低足高位处理）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-给药安全\">四、给药安全</h3><p>给药前必须执行&quot;三查八对&quot;制度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三查</strong>：操作前查、操作中查、操作后查</li>\n<li><strong>八对</strong>：对床号、姓名、药名、剂量、浓度、时间、用法、有效期</li>\n</ul>\n<p>口服给药的特殊注意事项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对胃黏膜刺激的药物：饭后服</li>\n<li>助消化药：饭前服</li>\n<li>催眠药：睡前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15 \\sim 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟</li>\n<li>强心苷类（地高辛）：服药前测心率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分或心律不齐暂停给药并通知医生</li>\n<li>降压药：测血压后给药，监测体位性低血压</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-基本生活护理\">五、基本生活护理</h3><p><strong>体位安置</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>体位</th>\n<th>适应证</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>半坐卧位</td>\n<td>心肺疾病、腹部术后</td>\n<td>改善呼吸、减少伤口张力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侧卧位</td>\n<td>意识不清、全麻未醒</td>\n<td>防止误吸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头高脚低位</td>\n<td>颈椎牵引</td>\n<td>利用体重反牵引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头低脚高位</td>\n<td>休克（下肢抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 \\sim 30°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>增加回心血量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中凹卧位</td>\n<td>休克</td>\n<td>头胸抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\sim 20°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20°</span></span></span></span></span>，下肢抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 \\sim 30°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>压疮预防与护理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Braden 量表评估风险（感觉感知、潮湿、活动度、移动性、营养、摩擦力/剪切力）</li>\n<li>翻身间隔：至少每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时一次</li>\n<li>减压设备：气垫床、泡沫垫</li>\n<li>分期评估：I 期（皮肤发红不变白）→ II 期（水疱/表皮破损）→ III 期（全层皮肤缺失）→ IV 期（深达肌肉/骨骼）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某患者输液医嘱：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span> 葡萄糖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> mL + 抗生素，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 小时输完。使用普通输液器（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 滴/mL），计算每分钟滴数。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在进行青霉素皮试操作时，描述从药液配制到结果判断的完整流程，包括阳性反应的处理措施。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较臀大肌注射和三角肌注射的适应证、定位方法和最大注射量的区别。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一位 ICU 患者 Braden 量表评分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 分（高风险）。制定详细的压疮预防护理计划，包括翻身计划、营养支持和减压措施。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>患者输液过程中突然出现寒战、高热（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>39.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 39.8°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39.8°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。分析可能的原因，描述应急处理步骤。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《基础护理学》</strong>（李小寒、尚少梅主编）：国内护理实践的核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Fundamentals of Nursing&quot; (Potter &amp; Perry)</strong>：全球使用最广泛的护理基础教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Lippincott&#39;s Nursing Procedures&quot;</strong>：操作规程的详细参考</li>\n<li><strong>中国护理操作技术规范</strong>：标准化操作流程</li>\n<li><strong>WHO 手卫生指南</strong>：&quot;五个时刻&quot;洗手法的科学依据</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>基础护理技术是护理职业能力的根基。生命体征监测是病情观察的首要手段，无菌技术是感染防控的核心保障，注射和输液技术是最常执行的侵入性操作，给药安全制度则守护着患者免受用药错误的伤害。每一项技术都有其严格的操作规范和安全要点，熟练而规范地执行这些操作是新手护士的首要学习目标。在此基础上，还需要发展临床判断能力——不仅会做操作，更要理解每项操作背后的原理和可能出现的异常情况。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学护理学 — 基础护理技术","id":"大学护理学-基础护理技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、生命体征监测","id":"一-生命体征监测"},{"level":3,"text":"二、无菌技术","id":"二-无菌技术"},{"level":3,"text":"三、注射技术","id":"三-注射技术"},{"level":3,"text":"四、给药安全","id":"四-给药安全"},{"level":3,"text":"五、基本生活护理","id":"五-基本生活护理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学护理学 — 健康评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/health-assessment"},"next":{"title":"大学护理学 — 内科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/medical-nursing"}}